    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is that it's not just a \"feeling.\" it's the reality. everything i spent my whole life building is gone. there's no \"new version\" of me to find. when you've reached your peak and just fall off a cliff, there's nowhere to go but down. it's like i'm just waiting for the rest of my life to catch up to the fact that i'm already done.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
